                0130b494b1 ("Update pin mux config.", 2018-04-03) --
                  UART1USEFPGA 0 -> 1, SPIM0USEFPGA 0 -> 1.
                02ea7ac01f ("Enable i2c2 bridge.", 2021-03-15) --
                  I2C2USEFPGA 0 -> 1.
              The last three flips all converge ON mainline's values
              (mainline v2026.07 has UART1USEFPGA=1, SPIM0USEFPGA=1,
              I2C2USEFPGA=1 [V]), which is why they do not appear in
